        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Jerusalem</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 3000 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">First settled near the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gihon-spring">Gihon Spring</a> between 3000 and 2800 BCE, according to archaeological evidence; no founder is known, and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bible">Bible</a> says <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/david">David</a> took it from the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jebusites">Jebusites</a> around 1000 BCE.</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val">On the southern spur of a plateau in the Judaean Mountains between the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mediterranean">Mediterranean</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dead-sea">Dead Sea</a>, in the Southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/levant">Levant</a>, claimed as a capital by both Israel and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/palestine">Palestine</a>.</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">the First and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/temple-in-jerusalem">Second Temples</a>; the Western Wall; the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/church-of-the-holy-sepulchre">Church of the Holy Sepulchre</a>; the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dome-of-the-rock">Dome of the Rock</a> and al-Aqsa; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aelia-capitolina">Aelia Capitolina</a>; the Crusader <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-jerusalem">Kingdom of Jerusalem</a>; the walls of Suleiman; sieges and conquests by many powers</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Today</span><span class="info-stat-val">A city of over a million people whose Old City is a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/world-heritage-site">World Heritage Site</a> and whose political status remains disputed between Israel and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/palestine">Palestine</a>.</span></div>
